# brz12_verdict(): the DATED WAIVER that lets two GL entities stop blocking five tasks.
#
# A waiver is the easiest thing in this repo to get wrong, because the failure mode is
# silence: it works by NOT failing, so a waiver that is too wide looks exactly like a
# waiver that is correct. These six checks exist so the shape is pinned rather than
# trusted -- in particular that it fails on GROWTH and on its own STALENESS, which is
# what separates a dated exception from "ignore NULL manifest_ids".
