# THE TAX INTERACTION, PINNED AND NOT ANSWERED. nhl_invoice_line declares ONE
# invoice_line_item_type column and both functions read it: AME007 maps `Tax` to TAX,
# while module_value refuses `Tax` because it selects no module. Gold's required-field
