# TASK 6: THE DCDD'S OWN VALIDATION RULES, AND THE ONE OUTCOME THAT MUST BE IMPOSSIBLE
#
# CHECKREFERENCES applies to 27 of the 91 populated workbook rows and cannot be satisfied
# from this lake -- hub_wd_reference exists and is empty, because its WORKDAY binding
# lands from a bronze schema that does not exist yet. A pass over an empty reference
# table reads as "27 fields validated" when nothing was compared against anything, on
# data going to a customer. Everything below exists to make that outcome unreachable, and
# the reachability is asserted as a VALUE -- the status string itself -- rather than as
# the presence of a word in a file, because ten checks in this plan have passed under
# mutation by matching a comment or a refusal message instead of behaviour.
# =================================================================================== #
print("\n== DCDD validation runs before anything is written ==")
